  "notes": {
    "fill-check": "Decides what a prose fragment inside a body becomes.",
    "fill-check.calcs.fragment": "A fragment, given its kind; whether its expression is written with it (inline); what is under its name: nothing, something under another heading Layer 1 wrote (elsewhere), prose, a method, or an expression; and whether that entry was written by the interpretation. A name used elsewhere is a clash: one component has one namespace. An inline expression is used (inline), but the interpretation writing an entry for it too is an overwrite. Without an inline expression: nothing or prose under the name leaves the fragment as prose (prose-left); a method is its content (fill); an expression is the content of a condition (fill), but not of something that happens or a value, which must be methods (not-a-method)."
  },
